        },
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> if scrolling is done using mouse, scrolling active pane scrolls inactive as well, but scrolling inactive DOESN'T scroll active.\r\n\r\nWhy is this a problem? Just move the mouse to the active buffer.\r\n\r\nIf we merge this PR then the inverse is not easily achievable. And this adds a special-case. So not worth it.",
            "created_at": "2026-09-26T14:35:03Z",
