        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "> Why is this a problem?\r\n\r\nPrinciple of least surprise? From the user's perspective, scrolling with mouse / keyboard should be the same, as in every other situation. They have to check the _docs_ to understand that this is intended.\r\n\r\n> If we merge this PR then the inverse is not easily achievable.\r\n\r\nThis is fair, though.",
